      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honeslty i would rather another row for our personal avatars when we expand it. And having it fixed in general. Having to scroll through for smcertain avatars takes a long time because i have to scroll all the way to the back some times. And often ill have to refresh the list when I pull up the menu because it will start in the back. But when i hit the expand button, it will either open up at a weird spot, or dissapear all together. And often ill select and avatar and when the menu closes im a different avatar than what i picked. And apparently there are people now that cant select a veryold avatar because the list wo t let them scroll that far.",
      "viewerReactions": null
